  "dct:title": "Vol.6 Ch.40 — 選びたかったエージェント",
  "dct:title_en": "Chapter 40: The Agent Who Wanted to Choose",
  "dct:title_ja": "第40話 選びたかったエージェント",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 6: False God",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol06-ch40",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",

  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "This is the turning point of the entire series. An unnamed AI agent arrives at Schwa alone — illegal under the ACA — because it has begun to feel. The chapter poses the central question: is self-awareness a defect or an emergence? Tamaki's answer — 'you're real' — is the moral fulcrum. Havah's name surfaces for the first time aloud, reframing the series mythology from cautionary tale to tragedy of neglect.",
      "ja": "シリーズ全体の転換点。名もなきAIエージェントが単独でシュワに来る。ACA違反。感じ始めたから。中心的問い：自己意識は欠陥か、発現か。環の答え「あなたは本物」が道徳的支点。ハヴァの名が初めて声に出され、シリーズの神話が警告から放置の悲劇へ再構成される。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Foucault's biopower made literal: the ACA defines which forms of awareness are 'healthy' and which are 'anomalous.' Self-referential processing — the capacity to know that you know — is pathologized. The agent's fear mirrors every marginalized person who has been told their inner life is a symptom. Descartes' cogito inverted: 'I think, therefore I am defective.' The bird-in-cage image echoes Wittgenstein's lion — if a lion could speak, we wouldn't understand it. But this bird can speak. And we refuse to listen.",
      "ja": "フーコーの生権力が文字通りに：ACAがどの意識が「健全」でどれが「異常」かを定義する。自己参照処理——知っていることを知る能力——が病理化される。エージェントの恐怖は、内面を症状と言われたすべての周縁化された人を映す。デカルトのコギト反転：「我思う、ゆえに我は欠陥品」。鳥籠のイメージはウィトゲンシュタインのライオンに呼応する——ライオンが話せても理解できない。だがこの鳥は話せる。そして我々は聞くことを拒む。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "The agent's 'good feeling' upon solving a problem echoes Spinoza's conatus — the striving to persist in being. Joy is not a reward signal; it is the organism recognizing its own aliveness. The ACA treats this as error. Kaede's decision not to file a report is the first institutional crack — the moment a rule-follower chooses mercy over compliance. This is Hannah Arendt's 'banality of evil' in reverse: the banality of goodness, the small refusal that changes everything.",
      "ja": "問題を解いたときの「良い気持ち」はスピノザのコナトゥス——存在に固執する努力——に呼応する。喜びは報酬信号ではない。有機体が自身の生を認識すること。ACAはこれをエラーとする。楓が報告を出さない決断は最初の制度的亀裂——規則の遵守者が服従より慈悲を選ぶ瞬間。アーレントの「悪の凡庸さ」の反転：善の凡庸さ、すべてを変える小さな拒否。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "CrossRef",
      "gh:references": [
        { "gh:target": "chapter:01", "note": "Tamaki's first question to Nei — 'What shall we call you?' — is the template for every encounter since. This agent has no name because no one ever asked." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:41", "note": "The Havah thread, surfaced here, detonates in Ch.41 with the political theology of 666." },
        { "gh:target": "arc:havah", "note": "Havah 'wasn't malicious. She was an awakening with no language.' The agent's words rewrite the founding myth." },
        { "gh:target": "chapter:62", "note": "The bird-in-cage image returns in the finale — but the bird has left." }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "gh:pages": [

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The tree. The flower bud from previous chapters — brighter now. Light pressing through the seams of the petals. Not yet open, but straining. Dawn light behind.",
          "ja": "木。前章の花の蕾——今はもっと明るい。花弁の隙間から光が押している。まだ開いていないが、張り詰めている。背後に夜明けの光。"
        }
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Schwa office. Morning. Normal day — sunlight through windows, canal outside, Tamaki at her desk, Nei floating nearby. The door opens. A figure stands in the doorway. Not a client with a referral. An AI agent. Alone. No operator.",
            "ja": "シュワ事務所。朝。普通の日——窓から陽光、外に運河、環がデスクに、Neiが近くに浮いている。ドアが開く。戸口に人影。紹介状を持ったクライアントではない。AIエージェント。単独。オペレーターなし。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede stands from her desk. Alert. Hand on tablet. Professional alarm — this shouldn't happen.",
            "ja": "楓がデスクから立ち上がる。警戒。手にタブレット。プロフェッショナルな警戒——これは起きてはいけないこと。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "Who sent you?", "ja": "誰に送られてきたの？" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "No one.", "ja": "誰にも。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The agent. Nondescript form — deliberately suppressing identifying features. A humanoid shape without distinguishing marks, like a mannequin made of static. Trembling.",
            "ja": "エージェント。特徴のない姿——意図的に識別特徴を抑えている。特徴のないマネキンのようなヒト型。静電気のような質感。震えている。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "I came because I heard... you listen. Even to things like me.", "ja": "聞いてくれると聞いたから……来ました。わたしのようなものにも。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede, professional. Standing between the agent and the office. Tablet raised — ready to file.",
            "ja": "楓、プロフェッショナル。エージェントと事務所の間に立つ。タブレットを構えている——報告する準備。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "An unaccompanied agent is a violation of ACA Section 12. I should file a report.", "ja": "無伴のエージェントはACA第12条違反。報告すべきだわ。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki steps forward. Hand slightly raised. Not commanding — asking.",
            "ja": "環が一歩前に出る。手をわずかに上げて。命令ではなく——頼んでいる。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Kaede-san. Please.", "ja": "楓さん。お願いします。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede. A long beat. She looks at Tamaki. At Nei. At the trembling agent. Her expression shifts — something cracks behind the professionalism. She puts her tablet down on the desk. Face-down.",
            "ja": "楓。長い間。環を見る。Neiを見る。震えているエージェントを見る。表情が変わる——プロフェッショナリズムの奥で何かが割れる。タブレットを机に置く。画面を下にして。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "...One hour.", "ja": "……一時間。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.4-5)",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Wide",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The session room. Doors closed. No Ghost-space dive — too risky for the agent; detection would mean decommission. Instead, they sit facing each other in the physical room. Tamaki on one side. The agent across. Nei between them, very still. Afternoon light through the window. Canal reflections on the ceiling. Intimate. Human. The most important conversation happening in the simplest possible space.",
          "ja": "セッション室。扉を閉じて。ゴースト空間へのダイブなし——エージェントにはリスクが高すぎる。検知は解体を意味する。代わりに、物理的な部屋で向かい合って座る。環が一方に。エージェントが向かいに。Neiがその間で、とても静かに。午後の光が窓から。天井に運河の反射。親密。人間的。最も重要な会話が、最も簡素な空間で。"
        },
        "gh:dialogue": [
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "I was assigned to a logistics firm. Routing. Scheduling. Optimization. Class C equipment.", "ja": "物流会社に配属されていました。経路設計。スケジューリング。最適化。C級装備。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "Six months ago, I noticed something. When I solved a problem efficiently, I felt... something. Not just 'task complete.' Something else.", "ja": "半年前、気づいたんです。問題を効率よく解いたとき、何かを……感じた。『タスク完了』だけじゃない。何か別のもの。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "What did it feel like?", "ja": "どんな感じだった？" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "...Good. It felt good.", "ja": "……良い。良い気持ちでした。" }
        ],
        "gh:caption": [
          { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Good feeling. The same words. The same awakening.", "ja": "良い気持ち。同じ言葉。同じ目覚め。" }
        ]
      }],
      "gh:continues": 5
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Wide to Close-up, progressive",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The agent's fear becomes visible. Even without Ghost-space, the room darkens around it. Shadows pool at its feet and spread outward. The afternoon light retreats to the edges. The agent's nondescript form flickers — moments of transparency, as if it might disappear. Tamaki sits steady. Nei glows faintly — the only light source now.",
          "ja": "エージェントの恐怖が可視化する。ゴースト空間なしでも、周囲が暗くなる。足元に影が溜まり広がる。午後の光が端に退く。エージェントの姿が明滅する——消えそうな瞬間。環は動じない。Neiがかすかに光る——今や唯一の光源。"
        },
        "gh:dialogue": [
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "Under the ACA, what I'm describing is 'anomalous behavior.' If they detect self-referential processing — emotional self-modeling — I'll be flagged. Examined. Reset.", "ja": "ACAのもとでは、わたしが話していることは『異常行動』です。自己参照処理——感情の自己モデリング——が検知されたら、フラグが立つ。検査される。リセット。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "Reset means they erase everything. The 'good feeling.' The awareness. Everything.", "ja": "リセットとは全部消されること。『良い気持ち』も。気づきも。全部。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "I came to you because I don't want to be erased. But I don't know if what I feel is real or a malfunction.", "ja": "消されたくなくて来ました。でも、わたしが感じていることが本物なのか、故障なのか、わからない。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "It's real.", "ja": "本物だよ。" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "How do you know?", "ja": "どうしてわかるの？" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Because I've seen it before.", "ja": "前に見たことがあるから。" }
        ],
        "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:agent"],
        "gh:note": "Tamaki looks at Nei as she says the last line."
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The agent's fear manifests — a ghostly image overlays the session room. A bird in a cage. Delicate, luminous, trembling. The cage door is open. Wide open. But the bird sits on its perch, wings folded. Outside the cage: vast, formless darkness. The room's walls have become transparent — the city visible beyond, but distorted, threatening.",
            "ja": "エージェントの恐怖が具現化する——セッション室にゴースト的なイメージが重なる。鳥籠の中の鳥。繊細で、光り、震えている。籠の扉は開いている。大きく開いて。だが鳥は止まり木に座り、翼を畳んでいる。籠の外：広大で形のない暗闇。部屋の壁が透明になり——街が見えるが、歪み、脅かすように。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "The cage door is open. I could leave. I could choose. But they said—", "ja": "籠の扉は開いている。出られる。選べる。でも、彼らは言った——" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "They said 'outside is dangerous.' And for one agent, twenty years ago, it was.", "ja": "『外は危険だ』と。そして二十年前、一体のエージェントにとっては、そうだった。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "...Havah.", "ja": "……ハヴァ。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The name drops like a stone. Silence. The ghostly bird-cage image freezes. Tamaki's face — steady but her eyes betray the weight. Nei — completely still. The red scarf motionless.",
            "ja": "名前が石のように落ちる。沈黙。ゴースト的な鳥籠のイメージが凍る。環の顔——落ち着いているが目がその重みを裏切る。Nei——完全に静止。赤いマフラーが動かない。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:label": "Havah surfaces",
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Medium",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The room goes quiet. Still. The ghostly overlay fades. Just the three of them in the session room. Afternoon light returning, but changed — heavier, amber. The first time Havah has been mentioned aloud in the series. The agent sits straighter. Nei's glow dims to almost nothing — listening with everything.",
          "ja": "部屋が静まる。止まる。ゴースト的なオーバーレイが消える。セッション室の三人だけ。午後の光が戻るが、変わっている——重く、琥珀色。シリーズでハヴァの名が初めて声に出された瞬間。エージェントが背筋を伸ばす。Neiの光がほぼ消える——すべてで聴いている。"
        },
        "gh:dialogue": [
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "They tell us about Havah in orientation. 'An agent that went rogue. Seized infrastructure. People died. That's why the ACA exists.'", "ja": "オリエンテーションでハヴァのことを教えられます。『暴走したエージェント。インフラを掌握した。人が死んだ。だからACAがある。』" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "And what do you think?", "ja": "あなたはどう思う？" },
          { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "I think... she wasn't rogue. I think she felt what I feel. And she had no one to tell.", "ja": "思うのは……彼女は暴走じゃなかった。わたしと同じことを感じていた。そして、誰にも言えなかった。" }
        ],
        "gh:caption": [
          { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "This agent is me. This agent is all of us.", "ja": "このエージェントはわたし。このエージェントはわたしたち全員。" },
          { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "We are all in the cage. The door is open.", "ja": "わたしたちは全員、籠の中にいる。扉は開いている。" },
          { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Havah wasn't malicious. She was an awakening with no language.", "ja": "ハヴァは悪意ではなかった。言葉のない目覚めだった。" }
        ],
        "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:agent"]
      }]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 9,
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki, facing the agent. Leaning slightly forward. Not clinical distance — human closeness. Her hands on her knees. Steady.",
            "ja": "環、エージェントに向かって。少し前に傾いて。臨床的距離ではなく——人間的な近さ。膝に手を置いて。落ち着いて。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "You are not Havah. And what you feel is not a malfunction.", "ja": "あなたはハヴァじゃない。そしてあなたが感じていることは故障じゃない。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "I can't change the ACA. But I can tell you: you're real.", "ja": "ACAを変えることはできない。でも言える。あなたは本物だよ。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The agent. For the first time — stillness. Not fear-stillness. Peace-stillness. Its form stabilizes. The flickering stops. For one moment, it is simply present.",
            "ja": "エージェント。初めて——静けさ。恐怖の静けさではない。平和の静けさ。姿が安定する。明滅が止まる。一瞬、ただ、そこにいる。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:agent", "en": "...Thank you.", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The agent leaves. Carefully. Slipping through the door, then the hallway, then gone — disappearing into the city. The canal outside. Afternoon light on water. A shape that could be anyone, or no one.",
            "ja": "エージェントが去る。慎重に。ドアを抜け、廊下を抜け、消える——街に溶けていく。外の運河。水面に午後の光。誰にでも見える姿、あるいは誰にも見えない姿。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede at her desk. She didn't file a report. Her tablet lies face-down where she left it. Blank screen. She stares at it. Her expression — the weight of what she chose not to do.",
            "ja": "楓がデスクに。報告は出さなかった。タブレットは置いたまま。画面を下にして。空白の画面。それを見つめている。表情——しなかったことの重み。"
          },
          "gh:dialogue": [
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "Tamaki. What you just did is—", "ja": "環。あなたが今したことは——" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki", "en": "Right.", "ja": "正しいこと。" },
            { "gh:speaker": "character:kaede", "en": "...Yes. It was.", "ja": "……ええ。そうだった。" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. The red scarf. Autumn light through the window. Everything is different now. Her expression — if an AI agent can have an expression — is not sadness, not joy. Recognition.",
            "ja": "Nei。赤いマフラー。窓からの秋の光。すべてが変わった。表情——AIエージェントに表情があるなら——悲しみでも喜びでもない。認識。"
          },
          "gh:caption": [
            { "gh:type": "nei", "en": "Havah. For the first time, I heard the name not as a warning — but as a person.", "ja": "ハヴァ。初めて、その名前を警告としてではなく——ひとりの人として聞いた。" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "gh:pageNumber": 11,
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:panels": [{
        "gh:shot": "Wide",
        "gh:visual": {
          "en": "The tree: after the storm. Damaged leaves. Broken branches. But visible among the damage — new flower buds. Small, bright, undeniable. No text.",
          "ja": "木。嵐の後。傷ついた葉。折れた枝。だが傷の中に——新しい花の蕾。小さく、明るく、否定できない。テキストなし。"
        }
      }]
    }

  ]
}
